<title>USA: Gaming Venture Corp announces Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Gaming Venture Corp announces Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LEE, N.J. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming Ventrure Corp USA said on Thursday net income for the third quarter ended July 11 was $64,189 or $0.04 per share.</p>
<p>It said net income for the first nine months of fiscal 1996 was $130,384 or $0.08 per share.  It said comparative figures for the first nine months of fiscal 1995 were not available as the company was formed in June 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;Net income for the third quarter equaled the results of the first half of the year,&quot; Gaming Venture Corp President Alan Woinski said.</p>
</text>
